    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mbīmbī ja sī ya Kanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakomelejage a Baisilaeli ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūlū mulingīle ū mu sī ya Kanani, ī sī ying'we īyo mulīīgabīlwa kūbiza wingīji wing'we ī mbīmbī jayo jiiji: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūbīmbī lwing'we ū lwa Dakama lūkūshika kwitogolo lya Zini, lūja lūlikilimbīja sī ya Edomu. Ī lipandī ī lya Kīīya, ū kū Dakama yaho ū lūbīmbī lwing'we lūkwandīja aho īgelelile nyanza ya munhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūgalūka kūlola Dakama, lūja lūlīlondeela ntulumenha gwa Akilabimu, lūūkashika Zini; hūna lūūgoloola kūja Dakama dūhū kūshisha Kadeshi balinea. Hanuma ya henaho, lūkūja lūūkashika ipandī lya Hazaali-adaali, kūshisha Azimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwandīja a henaho lūkūgalūka hangī lūje lūkagadye mu kalonga ka Misili, hūna lwika lūūkashilīla kū nyanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū Ng'weli, ū lūbīmbī lwing'we lūkūbiza ī mbalama ya nyanza ī nhaale. Ū lwenūūlū hū lūbīmbī lwing'we ū kū lwande ū lwa Ng'weli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū lwande ū lwa Sukuma, solagi nkwanga gwa kwīngīīla ū kū nyanza ī nhaale, kūja kū lūgūlū lwa Hooli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna ū kūfuma ū kū lūgūlū lwa Hooli, ng'ūja Lebo na kūshisha Hamati. Ū kūfuma ū kwenūko ū lūbīmbī lūkūīlīīla Zedadi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hūna lūūgoloola lūjile kūshisha lūūkashika Zifloni, kūjūgelela Hazaali-enani. Ū lwenūūlū hū lūkūbiza lūbīmbī lwing'wa ū kū lwande ū lwa Sukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū Kīīya, ū lūbīmbī lwing'we lūkwandīja Hazaali-enani kūshisha Shefamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama lūūtulumenha kūfuma ī Shefamu kūīlīla Libula, kīya ya Aini, hūna lūja gīko dūhū lūkwikilimbījaga nyanza ya Kineleti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwīnga a henaho ū lūbīmbī lwenūlo lūkūtulumenha kūīlīīla kū mongo gwa Yolodani lūūkashilīla mu nyanza ya munhu. Ī yenīyī h'īkūbiza sī ying'we na mbīmbī jayo hose hose būlī ipandī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūbalagīla a Baisilaeli alīhaya, “Īgabanhyagi ī sī yenīyī mubinhe a banhū ū wingīji wabo. Ū SEEBA walagīlile gīkī īgabanhyiwe ū kū ng'anda ījo kenda na nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī ng'anda ja ba Lubeni na Gadi, nī nusu ya Manase ī jene jamalile kwanukūla ū wingīji wajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'anda īj'ibīlī na nusu jenījo janukūlile ū wingīji wajo ū kū ntambūko gwa Kīīya ya mongo gwa Yolodani, ī lipandī īlo liilolile na nzengo gwa Yeliko; ū kū būfuma līīmi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A mina aya hū ga banhū abo bakwīgabanhya ī sī ya wingīji wing'we, Ngabīji Elieza na Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūkūsola na ntongeeji ūmò kūfuma mu būlī lūganda, wa kūgunanha ū mu kwīgabanhya ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya hū a mina ga banhū benabo:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A benaba hū bene a banhū abo SEEBA akalagīla gīkī babize bagabanhya bayo ī sī ya Kanani ū mu Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.34.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
